  "sameMechanismAuditConclusion": "Strict world/career/trait/character/repair tasks now share the DeepSeek non-thinking policy. Other structured calls already receive the 60 second remote minimum and retain provider-default reasoning only where narrative/reasoning is part of the task contract."
